cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "neuroguIA Dataset"
message: "If you use this dataset in academic research, publications, or derivative work, please cite the archived version using the metadata below."
type: dataset

authors:
  - family-names: "De León"
    given-names: "Cristhianne"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4777-1741"

abstract: >
  neuroguIA Dataset is an anonymized conversational artificial intelligence
  dataset designed for socioemotional support research in neurodivergent
  contexts. The dataset includes research instruments, conversational sessions,
  contextual memory structures, semantic processing signals, adaptive
  conversational routing, psychometric results, longitudinal interaction data,
  analytical resources, and structured files prepared for PostgreSQL and
  Supabase.

